<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Walter of Geroldseck</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">d. 1263</span></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Walter of Geroldseck was <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bishop">Bishop</a> of Strasbourg from 1260. He tried to restore episcopal control over the city's government, but its citizens defeated his army at the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-hausbergen">Battle of Hausbergen</a> in 1262. The defeat ended the bishops' rule over Strasbourg, which became a free imperial city, while later bishops governed their territory from <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/saverne">Saverne</a>.</p></div>
